  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by virtue of its layout, siting and lack of reliance on the main dwellinghouse no. 42 Barrett Road, would not constitute ancillary accommodation. It proposes separate access from Evelyn Road and instead is considered to constitute a form of backland development. This use would be an out of character addition to the streetscene which is not in-keeping with the established character of the wider area. Additionally it would set an unacceptable principle that promotes substandard living accommodations for future occupiers. On this basis the proposal fails to comply with the objectives of Policies 53, 56 and 57 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
